    "excerpt": "25 HR & Behavioural interview questions grouped by subtopic, with level, type and companies where the topic is commonly tested (Accenture, Adobe, Amazon, Capgemini, Cognizant…).",
    "sourceUrl": "https://learnhub.local/interview/question-bank-hr-behavioural",
