    "level": "Intermediate",
    "content": "## Scope\nQuestion-only bank for **HR & Behavioural** interviews. Use it as a checklist: answer each out loud, then mark weak areas.\n\n- **Levels:** Beginner → Intermediate → Advanced\n- **Types:** Concept, Coding, Scenario, Design, Behavioural\n- **Companies:** indicative of where the topic is commonly tested — search the site for a company name (e.g. \"TCS\") to filter across all skills.\n\n\n## Visual overview\nAuto-generated from this lesson’s **title, tags, and headings** — refresh anytime with `npm run hub:diagrams`.\n\n### Process flowchart\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  Start[Interview] --> N0[Introduction]\n  N0 --> N1[Strengths]\n  N1 --> N2[Situations]\n  N2 --> N3[Leadership]\n  N3 --> N4[Client]\n```\n\n### Topic mindmap\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((Interview question bank HR Behavioural 2))\n    Interview\n    Question Bank\n    HR Behavioural\n    Accenture\n    Adobe\n    Amazon\n    Practice\n      Checklist\n      Failure modes\n```\n\n\n### Introduction\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Tell me about yourself. | Beginner | Behavioural | Cognizant, EY, Google, PwC |\n| 2 | Walk me through your current project and your role in it. | Beginner | Behavioural | Adobe, EY, IBM, TCS |\n| 3 | Why do you want to leave your current company? | Beginner | Behavioural | Accenture, Google, Tech Mahindra, Wipro |\n| 4 | Why do you want to join our company? | Beginner | Behavioural | Cognizant, EY, KPMG, PwC |\n| 5 | Where do you see yourself in five years? | Beginner | Behavioural | Amazon, KPMG, TCS, Tech Mahindra |\n\n### Strengths\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | What are your strengths and weaknesses? | Beginner | Behavioural | Cognizant, Infosys, Microsoft, Oracle |\n| 2 | What is your biggest professional achievement? | Intermediate | Behavioural | Cognizant, Google, PwC, Wipro |\n\n### Situations\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Describe a time you handled a conflict with a teammate. | Intermediate | Behavioural | Flipkart, IBM, Infosys, Wipro |\n| 2 | Tell me about a time you missed a deadline. What did you learn? | Intermediate | Behavioural | Capgemini, Deloitte, Infosys, Oracle |\n| 3 | Describe a situation where you disagreed with your manager. | Intermediate | Behavioural | Adobe, Google, LTIMindtree, Microsoft |\n| 4 | Tell me about a time you worked under pressure. | Intermediate | Behavioural | Capgemini, HCLTech, LTIMindtree, Tech Mahindra |\n| 5 | Describe a mistake you made in production and how you handled it. | Intermediate | Behavioural | Capgemini, Cognizant, Deloitte, LTIMindtree |\n| 6 | Tell me about a time you learned a new technology quickly. | Intermediate | Behavioural | Adobe, Amazon, EY, Tech Mahindra |\n\n### Leadership\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | How have you mentored junior team members? | Advanced | Behavioural | IBM, KPMG, Oracle, TCS, Wipro |\n| 2 | Describe a time you influenced a decision without authority. | Advanced | Behavioural | Amazon, Cognizant, Infosys, Microsoft, Oracle |\n| 3 | How do you handle an underperforming team member? | Advanced | Behavioural | Capgemini, Cognizant, Google, HCLTech, IBM |\n\n### Client\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | How do you handle a difficult client or stakeholder? | Intermediate | Behavioural | Cognizant, EY, Flipkart, Google |\n| 2 | Describe a time you had to push back on a client requirement. | Advanced | Behavioural | Cognizant, Flipkart, HCLTech, KPMG, TCS |\n\n### Work style\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Are you comfortable with shifts, relocation or travel? | Beginner | Behavioural | Capgemini, Google, Oracle, PwC |\n| 2 | How do you prioritise when you have multiple deadlines? | Beginner | Behavioural | Adobe, Capgemini, KPMG, Tech Mahindra |\n\n### Offer\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | What are your salary expectations and notice period? | Beginner | Behavioural | EY, IBM, Infosys, Tech Mahindra |\n| 2 | Do you have any other offers? | Beginner | Behavioural | KPMG, PwC, Tech Mahindra, Wipro |\n\n### Closing\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Do you have any questions for us? | Beginner | Behavioural | Adobe, Flipkart, PwC, Tech Mahindra |\n\n### Values\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | What does ownership mean to you? Give an example. | Intermediate | Behavioural | HCLTech, IBM, KPMG, Oracle |\n| 2 | Tell me about a time you went beyond your job description. | Intermediate | Behavioural | Flipkart, Google, KPMG, PwC |\n\n## How to practise\n1. Pick one subtopic per day.\n2. Answer in 60–90 seconds; write code for Coding rows.\n3. Revisit Advanced rows before product-company or architect rounds.\n",
