    "content": "## Scope\nQuestion-only bank for **Cloud & DevOps** interviews. Use it as a checklist: answer each out loud, then mark weak areas.\n\n- **Levels:** Beginner → Intermediate → Advanced\n- **Types:** Concept, Coding, Scenario, Design, Behavioural\n- **Companies:** indicative of where the topic is commonly tested — search the site for a company name (e.g. \"TCS\") to filter across all skills.\n\n\n## Visual overview\nAuto-generated from this lesson’s **title, tags, and headings** — refresh anytime with `npm run hub:diagrams`.\n\n### Process flowchart\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  Start[Interview] --> N0[Git]\n  N0 --> N1[CI/CD]\n  N1 --> N2[Docker]\n  N2 --> N3[Kubernetes]\n  N3 --> N4[AWS]\n```\n\n### Topic mindmap\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((Interview question bank Cloud DevOps 30 ))\n    Interview\n    Question Bank\n    Cloud DevOps\n    Accenture\n    Adobe\n    Amazon\n    Practice\n      Checklist\n      Failure modes\n```\n\n\n### Git\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | git merge vs rebase: when do you use each? | Beginner | Concept | Accenture, Cognizant, Google, PwC |\n| 2 | How do you resolve a merge conflict and recover a lost commit (reflog)? | Intermediate | Concept | Amazon, Capgemini, KPMG, PwC |\n| 3 | Explain a branching strategy you have used: GitFlow vs trunk-based. | Intermediate | Concept | Cognizant, Infosys, Oracle, TCS |\n\n### CI/CD\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | What is CI/CD and what stages does a typical pipeline have? | Beginner | Concept | Accenture, Microsoft, TCS, Tech Mahindra |\n| 2 | Jenkins declarative vs scripted pipelines. | Intermediate | Concept | Infosys, Microsoft, PwC, Tech Mahindra |\n| 3 | How do you manage secrets in a CI/CD pipeline? | Intermediate | Concept | Adobe, Flipkart, HCLTech, Wipro |\n| 4 | Explain blue-green, canary and rolling deployments. | Advanced | Concept | Adobe, Deloitte, EY, LTIMindtree, PwC |\n\n### Docker\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Container vs virtual machine. | Beginner | Concept | Google, HCLTech, Infosys, Oracle |\n| 2 | Explain a Dockerfile and how layer caching works. | Intermediate | Concept | Flipkart, Google, HCLTech, Infosys |\n| 3 | CMD vs ENTRYPOINT; COPY vs ADD. | Intermediate | Concept | Cognizant, HCLTech, LTIMindtree, TCS |\n| 4 | How do you reduce Docker image size (multi-stage builds)? | Intermediate | Concept | Accenture, Adobe, Flipkart, TCS |\n| 5 | What is Docker Compose used for? | Intermediate | Concept | EY, IBM, KPMG, TCS |\n\n### Kubernetes\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Explain Pod, Deployment, Service and Ingress. | Intermediate | Concept | Accenture, Deloitte, Infosys, Wipro |\n| 2 | ConfigMap vs Secret. | Intermediate | Concept | Adobe, Flipkart, Infosys, KPMG |\n| 3 | How do liveness and readiness probes differ? | Advanced | Concept | Adobe, Cognizant, Oracle, PwC, TCS |\n| 4 | How does Horizontal Pod Autoscaler work? | Advanced | Concept | Adobe, Capgemini, EY, TCS, Wipro |\n| 5 | A pod is in CrashLoopBackOff. How do you debug it? | Advanced | Scenario | EY, Google, LTIMindtree, PwC, TCS |\n\n### AWS\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Explain EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda and VPC at a high level. | Beginner | Concept | Accenture, Cognizant, EY, LTIMindtree |\n| 2 | IAM users vs roles vs policies. | Intermediate | Concept | Accenture, Infosys, Microsoft, Tech Mahindra |\n| 3 | S3 storage classes and lifecycle policies. | Intermediate | Concept | EY, LTIMindtree, Microsoft, Tech Mahindra |\n| 4 | How do you design a highly available web app on AWS? | Advanced | Concept | Capgemini, Google, Infosys, TCS, Wipro |\n\n### Azure\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Explain Azure DevOps pipelines, boards and artifacts. | Intermediate | Concept | Amazon, EY, Google, IBM |\n| 2 | Azure App Service vs AKS vs Functions: when to use each? | Intermediate | Concept | Amazon, Cognizant, KPMG, TCS |\n\n### IaC\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | What is Terraform state and why must it be stored remotely? | Intermediate | Concept | Adobe, Cognizant, Google, PwC |\n| 2 | Terraform vs Ansible: provisioning vs configuration management. | Advanced | Concept | Accenture, Flipkart, HCLTech, LTIMindtree, TCS |\n\n### Monitoring\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | How do you set up monitoring with Prometheus and Grafana? | Intermediate | Concept | Adobe, KPMG, PwC, Wipro |\n| 2 | Explain logs, metrics and traces (observability pillars). | Advanced | Concept | Capgemini, Google, Infosys, LTIMindtree, Microsoft |\n\n### Linux\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Common Linux commands for troubleshooting: ps, top, df, grep, tail, netstat. | Beginner | Concept | Accenture, EY, Google, IBM |\n\n### Networking\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Explain DNS resolution and what happens when you type a URL. | Intermediate | Concept | Adobe, Google, HCLTech, TCS |\n\n### Security\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | What is DevSecOps and which scans belong in a pipeline? | Advanced | Concept | Flipkart, KPMG, Microsoft, PwC, Wipro |\n\n## How to practise\n1. Pick one subtopic per day.\n2. Answer in 60–90 seconds; write code for Coding rows.\n3. Revisit Advanced rows before product-company or architect rounds.\n",
