    "content": "## Scope\nQuestion-only bank for **SAP (MM / SD / FICO)** interviews. Use it as a checklist: answer each out loud, then mark weak areas.\n\n- **Levels:** Beginner → Intermediate → Advanced\n- **Types:** Concept, Coding, Scenario, Design, Behavioural\n- **Companies:** indicative of where the topic is commonly tested — search the site for a company name (e.g. \"TCS\") to filter across all skills.\n\n\n## Visual overview\nAuto-generated from this lesson’s **title, tags, and headings** — refresh anytime with `npm run hub:diagrams`.\n\n### Process flowchart\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  Start[Interview] --> N0[General]\n  N0 --> N1[MM]\n  N1 --> N2[SD]\n  N2 --> N3[FICO]\n  N3 --> N4[Integration]\n```\n\n### Topic mindmap\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((Interview question bank SAP MM / SD / FI))\n    Interview\n    Question Bank\n    SAP MM / SD / FICO\n    Accenture\n    Capgemini\n    Deloitte\n    Practice\n      Checklist\n      Failure modes\n```\n\n\n### General\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Explain the SAP organizational structure: client, company code, plant, storage location. | Beginner | Concept | EY, IBM, PwC, TCS |\n| 2 | What changed from ECC to S/4HANA (Universal Journal, Business Partner, MATDOC)? | Intermediate | Concept | Accenture, Capgemini, Infosys, TCS |\n| 3 | Explain the SAP Activate methodology phases. | Intermediate | Concept | Capgemini, EY, KPMG, LTIMindtree |\n\n### MM\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Explain the Procure-to-Pay cycle with T-codes. | Beginner | Concept | Accenture, Deloitte, Infosys, TCS |\n| 2 | What are movement types and name common ones (101, 261, 311, 551)? | Intermediate | Concept | EY, IBM, Infosys, LTIMindtree |\n| 3 | What is automatic account determination (OBYC) and how does valuation class fit in? | Intermediate | Concept | IBM, Infosys, KPMG, PwC |\n| 4 | Explain release strategy for purchase orders. | Intermediate | Concept | Capgemini, IBM, KPMG, TCS |\n| 5 | What is the difference between info record, source list and quota arrangement? | Intermediate | Concept | EY, IBM, KPMG, TCS |\n| 6 | Explain split valuation and when you would use it. | Intermediate | Concept | Deloitte, IBM, Infosys, KPMG |\n| 7 | Explain MRP types and the MRP run (MD01N/MD04). | Advanced | Concept | IBM, Infosys, KPMG, LTIMindtree, TCS |\n| 8 | GR/IR account is not clearing. How do you analyze it? | Advanced | Scenario | Capgemini, Deloitte, EY, Infosys, LTIMindtree |\n\n### SD\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Explain the Order-to-Cash cycle with T-codes. | Beginner | Concept | Accenture, IBM, LTIMindtree, TCS |\n| 2 | Explain pricing procedure determination and condition technique. | Intermediate | Concept | Capgemini, IBM, KPMG, LTIMindtree |\n| 3 | What is copy control and where is it configured? | Intermediate | Concept | Accenture, IBM, KPMG, TCS |\n| 4 | Explain item category determination. | Intermediate | Concept | Capgemini, EY, IBM, LTIMindtree |\n| 5 | What is credit management in S/4HANA? | Intermediate | Concept | Accenture, Capgemini, KPMG, LTIMindtree |\n| 6 | Explain revenue account determination (VKOA). | Advanced | Concept | Deloitte, EY, Infosys, KPMG, LTIMindtree |\n| 7 | An invoice is not getting posted to accounting. How do you troubleshoot? | Advanced | Scenario | Accenture, Capgemini, EY, KPMG, LTIMindtree |\n\n### FICO\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Explain the Record-to-Report process. | Beginner | Concept | Capgemini, EY, IBM, PwC |\n| 2 | What is a document splitting and why is it used? | Intermediate | Concept | Accenture, IBM, LTIMindtree, PwC |\n| 3 | Explain the Automatic Payment Program (F110). | Intermediate | Concept | Capgemini, Infosys, LTIMindtree, PwC |\n| 4 | Explain cost center vs profit center accounting. | Intermediate | Concept | Capgemini, EY, KPMG, LTIMindtree |\n| 5 | What is the new Asset Accounting in S/4HANA? | Intermediate | Concept | Capgemini, EY, PwC, TCS |\n| 6 | Explain month-end and year-end closing activities. | Advanced | Concept | Capgemini, Deloitte, IBM, KPMG, LTIMindtree |\n| 7 | How is CO-PA different between costing-based and account-based? | Advanced | Concept | Capgemini, Deloitte, EY, IBM, Infosys |\n\n### Integration\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | How do MM and FI integrate during goods receipt and invoice verification? | Intermediate | Concept | Capgemini, EY, KPMG, LTIMindtree |\n| 2 | Explain IDocs, BAPIs and RFCs and when each is used. | Advanced | Concept | Capgemini, EY, KPMG, LTIMindtree, PwC |\n\n### Testing\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | How do you plan SAP regression testing for a support pack upgrade? | Intermediate | Concept | Accenture, Capgemini, Deloitte, IBM |\n\n### Scenario\n\n| # | Question | Level | Type | Commonly asked at |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | How do you handle a data migration for open POs and sales orders? | Advanced | Scenario | Deloitte, IBM, KPMG, PwC, TCS |\n| 2 | Describe a complex requirement you solved using standard configuration instead of custom code. | Advanced | Scenario | EY, KPMG, LTIMindtree, PwC, TCS |\n\n## How to practise\n1. Pick one subtopic per day.\n2. Answer in 60–90 seconds; write code for Coding rows.\n3. Revisit Advanced rows before product-company or architect rounds.\n",
