    "content": "## Scope\nMaster index of the company interview question bank. Each skill set has its own lesson with questions grouped by subtopic.\n\n\n## Visual overview\nAuto-generated from this lesson’s **title, tags, and headings** — refresh anytime with `npm run hub:diagrams`.\n\n### Process flowchart\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  Start[Interview] --> N0[Skill sets]\n  N0 --> N1[Companies]\n  N1 --> N2[Study path]\n```\n\n### Topic mindmap\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((Company interview question bank 455 ques))\n    Interview\n    Question Bank\n    TCS\n    Infosys\n    Accenture\n    Deloitte\n    Practice\n      Checklist\n      Failure modes\n```\n\n\n## Skill sets\n| Skill | Questions | Beginner | Intermediate | Advanced |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Java & OOP | 35 | 6 | 20 | 9 |\n| Python | 32 | 5 | 19 | 8 |\n| SQL & Databases | 32 | 5 | 15 | 12 |\n| Data Structures & Algorithms | 35 | 6 | 19 | 10 |\n| JavaScript | 32 | 5 | 19 | 8 |\n| Selenium & Automation Frameworks | 30 | 3 | 18 | 9 |\n| Playwright | 30 | 4 | 19 | 7 |\n| Manual Testing & QA Process | 30 | 9 | 18 | 3 |\n| API Testing & REST | 28 | 5 | 15 | 8 |\n| Tricentis Tosca | 28 | 5 | 15 | 8 |\n| SAP (MM / SD / FICO) | 30 | 4 | 17 | 9 |\n| Cloud & DevOps | 30 | 5 | 17 | 8 |\n| GenAI & Machine Learning | 30 | 3 | 16 | 11 |\n| System Design | 28 | 0 | 8 | 20 |\n| HR & Behavioural | 25 | 11 | 10 | 4 |\n\n## Companies\n| Company | Tagged questions |\n|---|---|\n| Capgemini | 126 |\n| Accenture | 123 |\n| TCS | 116 |\n| Infosys | 111 |\n| Tech Mahindra | 111 |\n| LTIMindtree | 105 |\n| Cognizant | 102 |\n| Google | 101 |\n| Wipro | 99 |\n| Adobe | 97 |\n| HCLTech | 97 |\n| KPMG | 93 |\n| IBM | 92 |\n| PwC | 92 |\n| EY | 90 |\n| Microsoft | 87 |\n| Deloitte | 82 |\n| Flipkart | 81 |\n| Oracle | 80 |\n| Amazon | 69 |\n\nCompany tags are indicative of where a topic is commonly tested, not reported interview data.\n\n## Study path\n1. HR & Behavioural + your primary skill first.\n2. SQL and DSA basics — asked almost everywhere.\n3. Framework/tool depth (Selenium, Playwright, Tosca, SAP) for role-specific rounds.\n4. System Design and GenAI for senior and architect roles.\n",
